        <fields>
            <name>SlackChannel_Instructions</name>
            <fieldText>&lt;p&gt;&lt;em style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 20px; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web (West European)&amp;quot;, -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, Roboto, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, sans-serif; color: rgb(2, 92, 95);&quot;&gt;*** For the call summary, please post it in the internal Slack channel that will be created per step below.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Once the ticket has been confirmed as a legitimate security incident or prospective breach, create a private Slack channel but use only codewords of the incident. Type the first post as:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 16px; font-family: courier; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;This is a private channel to discuss the ongoing security incident at &amp;lt;customer name&amp;gt;.&amp;nbsp;Treat all info in this channel as confidential.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;In the private Slack channel, invite only those that have been identified who can help with the incident including account stakeholders:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Primary/secondary account TAMs&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;TAM RVP and TAM AVP (for the account)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Invite the identified ESS resource&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Any other Tanium personnel already aware/engaged (SMEs, other TAMs)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;STAM will follow the investigation and assist as needed during the incident.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</fieldText>
            <fieldType>DisplayText</fieldType>
            <styleProperties>
                <verticalAlignment>
                    <stringValue>top</stringValue>
                </verticalAlignment>
                <width>
                    <stringValue>12</stringValue>
                </width>
            </styleProperties>
        </fields>
        <nextOrFinishButtonLabel>Submit</nextOrFinishButtonLabel>
        <showFooter>true</showFooter>
        <showHeader>false</showHeader>
    </screens>
